      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Looks a battle between the two fillies that have been racking up the wins but the draw has given the advantage to the Victorian COMEANDSEE (3). She has dominated in both rounds of this series, the latest when she led and cruised home by 5.5m in her semi-final at this circuit and distance. Expect her to push forward again from this barrier and if she gets her way up front she'll be hard to catch. BIRDSONG (10) draws wide but she is already a Group 1 winner and is three from three at this circuit and distance this time in. Should be peaking for this and has won from similar barriers before. She could do it again. FRITH IN FLIGHT (7) is a progressive filly who won well here two back then raced parked and stuck on okay behind BIRDSONG last start. She is a trifecta hope as is SHES A DELANEY (11) who cops a wide draw but has the speed to go forward from out there and has been very consistent with a string of wins and placings to her name.",
